<div class="credit first">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p>
<p>作者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alan-233" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5498765); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5498765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605367128" alt="Alan_233" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5498765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alan-233" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5498765); return false;">Alan_233</a></span>（<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dr-a">点此查看更多作品</a>）</p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p>
